<title>SPAIN: Banco Popular to pay net dividend 211.5 pta/share.</title>
<headline>Banco Popular to pay net dividend 211.5 pta/share.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Popular said on Monday it would pay a final net dividend of 211.5 pesetas per share on July 4.</p>
<p>A statement from the bank said the gross dividend will be 282 pesetas per share.  </p>
<p>Banco Popular had already paid three interim dividends against its 1996 results for a total of 770 pesetas gross per share.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
